00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:34.180
JEENAL SHAH: Yeah, and it
has all the basic metrics,

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.350
like you said, Micah.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.760
That looks great.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.060
Next, can we jump
