00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:02.420
JEENAL SHAH: So it seems like
there are no obvious issues.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:07.510
So let's progress the rollout
to the green app to 100%.

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:09.010
MICAH BAKER: OK.

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:10.730
That sounds good.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.730
So I'm using that same
